      "id": "packages_rate_limit_readme_ratelimitguard",
      "label": "RateLimitGuard",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Consumes one token per request via RateLimitService, emits RateLimit-Limit/Remaining/Reset headers on allowed responses, and throws a 429 Problem Details refusal with Retry-After when exhausted.",
