      "id": "packages_rate_limit_readme_memoryratelimitstore",
      "label": "MemoryRateLimitStore",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Process-local fixed-window store bounded by maxKeys (default 10,000) that evicts the oldest insertion; multi-process deployments must supply a shared RateLimitStore.",
      "source_file": "packages/rate-limit/README.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_rate_limit_readme_route_identity_default_key",
      "label": "Route Identity Default Bucket Key",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Default bucket key uses route identity instead of X-Forwarded-For or other client-supplied headers because direct clients can spoof headers; custom key functions are only supplied when behind a trusted proxy.",
      "source_file": "packages/rate-limit/README.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_rate_limit_readme_429_problem_details",
      "label": "429 Problem Details Refusal with Retry-After",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Returns 429 Problem Details and Retry-After in whole seconds when the bucket is exhausted so clients wait for the reset window instead of retrying blindly.",
      "source_file": "packages/rate-limit/README.md",
      "source_location": null,
